sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / DSP Server
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Controller as workflow-controller<br/>9090/TCP metrics<br/>6060/TCP healthz
    participant Kubelet as Kubelet
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus
    participant Pod as Workflow Pod
    participant ArgoExec as argoexec sidecar
    participant S3 as Artifact Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant DB as PostgreSQL/MySQL<br/>5432,3306/TCP

    Note over User,S3: Flow 1: Workflow Execution

    User->>K8sAPI: Create Workflow CR<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Watch event (informer)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Workflow Pod<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>Pod: Schedule Pod
    Note over Pod,ArgoExec: argoexec injected as sidecar
    ArgoExec->>S3: Download input artifacts<br/>Auth: Cloud credentials
    S3-->>ArgoExec: Artifact data
    Note over Pod: Execute workflow step containers
    ArgoExec->>S3: Upload output artifacts<br/>Auth: Cloud credentials
    ArgoExec->>K8sAPI: Report task status<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Status update (informer)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update Workflow status<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount

    opt Workflow Archive Enabled
        Controller->>DB: Archive workflow<br/>Auth: Password
    end

    Note over Kubelet,Prometheus: Flow 2: Health & Monitoring

    Kubelet->>Controller: GET /healthz<br/>6060/TCP HTTP<br/>No Auth
    Controller-->>Kubelet: 200 OK
    Prometheus->>Controller: GET /metrics<br/>9090/TCP HTTP<br/>No Auth
    Controller-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics
